  "notes": [
    "DXC pinned tag v1.9.2609 (2026-09-29, the latest stable release per gh release list, meets the 1.8.2505 or later requirement). Submodules (SPIRV-Headers, SPIRV-Tools, DirectX-Headers) are fetched at that tag's commits. The SPIRV-Headers and SPIRV-Tools commits match the Vulkan SDK 1.4.363.0 tag.",
    "Built outside the engine build with the upstream build settings (exceptions and RTTI, cmake/caches/PredefinedParams.cmake) (Build/Build.ps1 and Build.sh, the prebuilt binary section of the warning policy). dxil.dll is not built (since 1.8.2505 the built-in validator signs).",
    "Only the public header dxcapi.h (which includes WinAdapter.h on non-Windows) is committed. On Windows dxcapi.h uses COM types (IUnknown, HRESULT), so the platform implementation that includes Windows headers first (P4 ShaderFormat) confirms zero warnings.",
    "There is no macos-arm64 output yet (Build.sh unverified)."
  ]
